invariant: INV-13
file: tcp_nonblocking_frame.c
catches: ticket_epoch_tcp_nonblocking
reason: ch_record_init zeroes the epoch fields when it refuses a CA build's
  ticket that the stored epoch retired, so its caller reads CH_EPOCH_NONE
  where ch_connect's reads CH_EPOCH_REVOKED, and cannot tell that refusal
  from any other. bin/ticket_epoch_tcp_nonblocking requires the stored
  epoch, the ticket's epoch and CH_EPOCH_REVOKED after the refusal.

--- old
    memset(r, 0, sizeof *r);
    r->t.epoch = epoch;
    r->t.epoch_seen = epoch_seen;
    r->t.epoch_status = epoch_status;
--- new
    memset(r, 0, sizeof *r);
    (void)epoch;
    (void)epoch_seen;
    (void)epoch_status;
